# Locked sheets + tabs

Dense overlays stay **locked** (fixed card, no background scroll). Split extra content into **tabs**; keep header + Save on screen.

Full pattern: [locked-sheet-tabs skill](../skills/locked-sheet-tabs/SKILL.md). Reference: player add/edit in `PlayersView.tsx`.

Do not “fix” overflow by scrolling the overlay or dropping `max-h` on the card.
